   1 a 0000 E46N19:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] PROTOCOL CONTROL.  Strict CRLF on every
   4 a 0006      line including the last, then 0x1A.  E46N20 is this
